Installed-Size: {SIZE}
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, zlib1g, libbz2-1.0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libgl1, libegl1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libgpg-error0, libcom-err2
Recommends: fuse3
Section: games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://antidote1911.github.io/Hydra64/
Description: Chess databases, engine analysis, play and engine tournaments
 Hydra64 is a chess workbench: it manages game databases, analyses with UCI
 engines, lets you play against an engine and runs tournaments between
 engines, in one interface with dockable panels.
 .
 This package holds the program with its own copy of Qt, the Stockfish and
 Shuffle engines and the bundled databases, in /opt/hydra64.
